type: card-list
title: Team Norms

- Async by default
  - Prefer written communication
  - Document decisions in writing
- Bias to action: 70% info threshold
  - Decide with the info you have
  - Unblock yourself first
- Daily standup at 9:30am
  - Keep it under 10min
  - One blocker per person
- Aspect ratio 16:9 for screenshares
  - Resolution: 1920x1080
  - 30fps minimum
